@startuml

class GenericADAA {
- _BACKEND: CoeffBackend
- _KEYMAP
- _FIXED_SIZE
- _DATATYPES
+ {abstract} identifier
+ {abstract} size
+ {abstract} data
+ unpack()
+ to_zeros()
+ copy()
+ free_memory()
+ reinit()
+ {static} allclose()
+ {static} basic_linop()
+ {static} set_keymap()
+ {static} fix_size()
+ {static} mul()
+ {static} div()
+ {static} add()
+ {static} sub()
+ {static} neg()
}


class ComplexArrayADAA {
    + {abstract} real
    + {abstract} imag
    + {static} basic_linop()
    + {static} from_numpy()
    + to_numpy()
}

GenericADAA <|-- ComplexArrayADAA
GenericADAA --> CoeffBackend : _BACKEND



interface CoeffBackend {

}



CoeffBackend <|.. RawPyCoeffBackend
CoeffBackend <|.. NumPyCoeffBackend
CoeffBackend <|.. FortranCoeffBackend
CoeffBackend <|.. CuPyCoeffBackend
CoeffBackend <|.. OpenClCoeffBackend
CoeffBackend <|.. PyCudaCoeffBackend


ComplexArrayADAA -right-> GenericADAA

@enduml

Selma
